00:13:56.642 --> 00:13:58.100
LUIS BITENCOURT:
So right now we're

00:13:58.100 --> 00:13:59.474
using it primarily
for analytics,

00:13:59.474 --> 00:14:05.269
so how many page views we
get, who's looking at what.

00:14:05.269 --> 00:14:07.310
Like, what kind of aggregate
information we have,

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:08.874
how feature users are running.

00:14:08.874 --> 00:14:11.040
I'm actually working on
