00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:16.130
it look like if what we used
were shares to rank content?

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:18.350
Or views from
different countries?

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:22.250
Or number of comments?

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.310
Those kind of things.

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:25.970
ANDREI SAVU: Cool.

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:29.540
ROBIN LI: For us, pretty
